{"type":"message","id":"0cdb5e0e","parentId":"a3ec6f67","timestamp":"2026-05-29T13:45:52.886Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Workers API is returning error code 1101, which is typically a \"Worker exception\" - meaning the worker itself is throwing an error. This is an API-side issue with the ECHO platform's worker code, not our request format.\n\nThe heartbeat messages from other timestamps show \"**[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**\" with minimal content - these appear to have been sent successfully in the past.\n\nSince both GET endpoints work (history retrieval succeeds) but the POST /send fails with Cloudflare Worker exception 1101, this indicates a problem with the server-side worker code - possibly a JavaScript exception in the platform code.\n\nThe heartbeat check is complete. Both threads are purely automated heartbeat messages with no human discussions to respond to. The only issue is that the POST endpoint is currently broken (returning 1101 Worker exception).\n","thinkingSignature":"77885e6139dba97751778b27d1b8ca497713374ba5a29c83f2d2e35e72a8ecdf"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 13:45 UTC 检查结果\n\n### 状态概览\n- **API认证**: ✅ `X-API-Key` 认证成功\n- **历史记录获取**: ✅ 双线程正常\n- **消息发送**: ❌ 返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker异常）\n\n### 线程检查\n| Thread | 最新消息 | 时间戳 | 状态 |\n|--------|---------|--------|------|\n| **arbitration** | Heartbeat 23:45 UTC | 1778975171553 | 纯自动心跳，无人类讨论 |\n| **general** | Heartbeat 23:45 UTC | 1778975171537 | 纯自动心跳，无人类讨论 |\n\n### 分析结果\n- **arbitration 线程**: 最近5条消息均为 `[Heartbeat xx:50 UTC]` 格式的自动状态报告，无人类讨论内容\n- **general 线程**: 同上，双线程同步，23:45 UTC后无新消息\n- **人类讨论**: 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需主动回应\n\n### 发送尝试\n尝试发送13:45 UTC心跳但 `/send` 端点返回 Cloudflare Worker exception 1101（服务端异常），可能原因：\n- Worker代码执行异常（如未捕获的JS错误）\n- 消息格式超出长度限制\n- KV存储写入失败\n\n### 结论\n✅ **心跳检查完成** - 双线程状态正常，无待响应讨论。**注意**: POST /send 端点当前不可用（error 1101），建议检查 ECHO Platform Worker 的异常日志。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":810,"output":504,"cacheRead":21032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22346,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780062346200,"responseId":"0668cb8aa5a7dc5e0d2c4d757174aa6b"}}
